  "statement": "What is the value of \\[ \\begin{aligned} &\\sqrt{\\left(3-2\\sqrt{3}\\right)^2} \\\\ &{}+\\sqrt{\\left(3+2\\sqrt{3}\\right)^2}? \\end{aligned} \\]",
